Package: AchillesNext
Type: Package
Title: Development Tracer for OMOP Characterization Results
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Chen", email = "alex@omophub.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes exact counts, observation opportunity and bounded measurement
    representations and reference distributions from marked synthetic PostgreSQL
    fixtures and writes a partial, versioned aggregate
    bundle for a reusable React view. This development tracer does not implement the complete
    characterization profile or production publication and recovery.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: DatabaseConnector (>= 6.3.2), digest, jsonlite, rJava, httpuv (>= 1.6.0)
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 8), PostgreSQL JDBC driver
URL: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next
BugReports: https://github.com/alex-omophub/achilles-next/issues
